{
  "Name": "Sync Breeze Enterprise GET Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a stack-based buffer overflow vulnerability in the web interface of Sync Breeze Enterprise v9.4.28, v10.0.28, and v10.1.16, caused by improper bounds checking of the request in HTTP GET and POST requests sent to the built-in web server. This module has been tested successfully on Windows 7 SP1 x86.",
